%   ours.
%   \emph{Reopens:} generated flows where keeping the break no longer leaves more empty
%   than dropping it, against the numbers below, measured again as \cref{app:pb-measure}
%   says.
%   \emph{Measured, rejected:} with the chunks \textsf{noweb} sets, keeping it leaves up
%   to 7.6 lines and 33 pages with three or more, against 5.6 and 20, in about 210 pages,
%   and 19 fewer breaks inside chunks.
%   With those woven for \texttt{minted}, under the limit, 6.2 and 28, against 4.5 and 17;
%   it helps only along with the limit.} \\
