% What can't be kept warns & Where it can see it &
%   Mostly silent. \\*
% \multicolumn{3}{@{}p{.96\linewidth}@{}}{\emph{Basis:} ours; a layout is correct or
%   says that it isn't, but for what it can't see, listed in \cref{KeepListingsUsage}.
