  |else|ifnum`#1<14
    |def|@didactic@keep@scannext[|@didactic@keep@scan#2|@nil]%
  |else|if\#1%
    |def|@didactic@keep@scannext[|@didactic@keep@scanprefix#2PYG {|@nil]%
  |else
    |@tempswafalse
    |let|@didactic@keep@scannext|relax
  |fi|fi|fi
  |@didactic@keep@scannext]
|gdef|@didactic@keep@scanprefix#1PYG {#2|@nil[%
  |if|relax|detokenize[#1]|relax
    |def|@didactic@keep@scannext[|@didactic@keep@scansplit#2}{|relax}|@nil]%
  |else
    |@tempswafalse
    |let|@didactic@keep@scannext|relax
