    |@tempswafalse
    |let|@didactic@keep@scannext|relax
  |else
    |def|@didactic@keep@scanafter[|@didactic@keep@scanstrip#3|@stop]%
    |def|@didactic@keep@scannext[|@didactic@keep@scan#2|@empty|@nil]%
  |fi
  |@didactic@keep@scannext]
|gdef|@didactic@keep@scanstrip#1|@empty PYG {}{|relax}#2|@stop[%
