% A run-in title that is still waiting (a frame title, say, before a block)
% takes a line of its own when this heading starts, which we don't count: the chain
% holds there.
% The headings of the blocks are those of \textsf{amsthm}'s theorems, 
% run-in at the start of their first paragraph, which start with 
